# initialise the simulation
/run/initialize

# basic graphical settings
/vis/open OGLSQt
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/scene/add/trajectories smooth
/vis/scene/endOfEventAction accumulate

# optional: cartesian reference (at the centre of the world)
#/vis/scene/add/axes 0 0 0

# don't shot anything --> waiting for manual input from the GUI